Routing:
“Routing ka matlab hai user ki HTTP request ke URL aur method ke according decide karna ke 
kaunsa code execute hoga aur kya response milega.”

const express = require("express");
const app = express();

app.get("/", (req, res) => {
  res.send("Home Page");
});

app.get("/about", (req, res) => {
  res.send("About Page");
});

app.post("/users", (req, res) => {
  res.send("User Created");
});

app.listen(3000);

Samjho
- app.get("/") — Home page ki GET request handle karega.
- app.get("/about") — About page ki GET request handle karega.
- app.post("/users") — User create karne ki POST request handle karega.
- req — Request ki information rakhta hai.
- res — Client ko response bhejne ke liye use hota hai.